  <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
    <p>Dry Roofs brings more than 30 years of roofing expertise to homes and businesses across South Yorkshire. The company focuses on practical solutions, careful workmanship and the kind of attention to detail that helps every roof perform well and look right.</p>
    <p>From complete roof replacements to flat roofing systems and smaller repairs, the work is shaped around what each property needs. Whether the project is major or minor, the goal stays the same: deliver a reliable result with a professional, straightforward service from start to finish.</p>
    <p>That approach is backed by a commitment to high standards and guaranteed work, giving clients peace of mind while keeping the process clear and well managed.</p>
